{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A kit with Support Barreira in his Typhoon Epic Outfit as well as Coins and days of Premium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This kit contains:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support Barreira from the BOPE collection:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Barreira is armed with an HK21 machine gun with a 200-round belt and a shield that protects his chest. While his ability is active, Barreira can shoot through covers, and his special gear restores stamina and can grant immunity to negative status effects when using appropriate upgrades. His Personal Skill increases armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Typhoon Epic Outfit for Barreira:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An alternative outfit for the operator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10,000 Coins:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coins can be spent on operators, customization items, and progress boosting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 days of Premium:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Premium speeds up in-game progress and unlocks Premium objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +20% XP if all teammates have active Premium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +10% XP for all teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +100% XP in all types of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 +30% XP in the new Battle Pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014\u00a0Increases gained Karma Points by 20%.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2440196?t=1746017399","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2440196?t=1746017399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam